    Platform II (Lighthouse): Outbound 21:55  |  Return 22:50
    Platform III (Coast):     Outbound 21:15  |  Return 23:30
    Platform IV (Station):    Outbound 22:10  |  Return 22:35

    Each platform matches a numbered bolt on the east wall.
